/-!
# Axiom audit for every declaration recorded in `audit/statements.json`

All 221 declarations named in the structured fields of `results.json`: the results (`lean`),
the declarations cited by name (`lean_names`), the non-vacuity witnesses, the positive controls and
the hypothesis counterexamples.

Not part of the `Toy` library target. Run from this directory after `lake build`:

    lake env lean RevalidationAudit.lean

Each `#print axioms` line must report no axioms or a subset of `propext`, `Classical.choice`,
`Quot.sound`. Statement and definition-closure hashes are recomputed by `support/revalidate.py`
(see the package's Revalidation section).
-/

